You announced Reiser4 public beta program to start in july. Even today, =
ther's no real beta-testing package, which should contain a working =
patch for linux-2.6-test1, and validated libaal and reiser4progs source =
package. I think the first linux 2.6 test version is the occasion for =
the Namesys team to show out the real power of Reiser4 and start this =
long-avaited beta test program, as the linux-2.6 sources will be =
availalbe for evaluation purposes on all the main linux distribution.
I don't know if Reiser4 is mature enough to be tested by the public, but =
announcing Reiser4-beta along with the first linux 2.6 test version may =
be a good thing for Namesys' image.
So I'd just like to ask you about the project's actual state, and the =
eventual first beta release date ...

